use most recent Bluefield-2 firmware releases require a hardware restart to switch into NIC mode.\n\n**Additional resources**\n{._additional-resources}\n\n- [Installing SR-IOV Network Operator](/openshift-docs-markdown/networking/networking_operators/sr-iov-operator/installing-sriov-operator#installing-sriov-operator)\n","mdUrl":"https://dogsbay.github.io/openshift-docs-markdown/networking/hardware_networks/switching-bf2-nic-dpu.md"} ?? undefined;
