      <h2 id="proc-switching-bf2-nic_switching-bf2-nic-dpu" class="group scroll-mt-20">Switching Bluefield-2 from DPU mode to NIC mode<a href="#proc-switching-bf2-nic_switching-bf2-nic-dpu" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Use the following procedure to switch Bluefield-2 from data processing units (DPU) mode to network interface controller (NIC) mode.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>Currently, only switching Bluefield-2 from DPU to NIC mode is supported. Switching from NIC mode to DPU mode is unsupported.</p>
